WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.623 --> 00:00:15.524
Ben recognized the voice right away.

2
00:00:16.444 --> 00:00:17.185
It was Mog!

3
00:00:17.785 --> 00:00:20.087
There was a two-headed dog by his side.

4
00:00:21.227 --> 00:00:22.388
"What are you doing here?"

5
00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:23.669
Mog demanded.

6
00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:26.911
"I couldn't sleep," Ben said quickly.

7
00:00:27.831 --> 00:00:29.232
He landed in front of Mog.

8
00:00:30.448 --> 00:00:32.310
"I was just flying around Monsterville."

9
00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:36.153
"Just flying around?"

10
00:00:36.674 --> 00:00:37.454
Mog echoed.

11
00:00:38.515 --> 00:00:40.857
He narrowed his eyes and moved closer to Ben.

12
00:00:40.877 --> 00:00:42.959
"Winnie loves to fly.

13
00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:46.602
I bet you're looking for those two missing brooms to impress her!"

14
00:00:47.603 --> 00:00:50.646
Ben was surprised that Mog had guessed the truth so quickly.

15
00:00:51.647 --> 00:00:53.388
He backed away from the big monster.

16
00:00:53.408 --> 00:00:57.192
"No, I'm just flying around," he repeated.

17
00:00:58.972 --> 00:01:00.373
Suddenly Mog smiled.

18
00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.914
"I'm just kidding," he said.

19
00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:08.958
"I'll tell you a secret, but you have to promise not to tell anyone, not one single monster!"

20
00:01:08.978 --> 00:01:12.519
"Why is Mog being so friendly all of a sudden?"

21
00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:13.560
Ben thought.

22
00:01:14.661 --> 00:01:18.122
He was suspicious, but aloud he said, "I won't tell."

23
00:01:18.142 --> 00:01:21.924
"Come closer," said Mog.

24
00:01:21.944 --> 00:01:24.726
"I have to whisper so no one will hear."

25
00:01:24.746 --> 00:01:29.324
"But there's no one here but us," said Ben.

26
00:01:29.344 --> 00:01:33.165
"You never know," said Mog, glancing around.

27
00:01:33.185 --> 00:01:37.006
"There could be spies on either side of the fence."

28
00:01:39.307 --> 00:01:41.748
Ben hovered so he was at eye level with Mog.

29
00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:44.988
"Closer!" hissed Mog.

30
00:01:45.969 --> 00:01:47.029
Ben moved closer.

31
00:01:47.049 --> 00:01:51.650
"I've been looking for the missing brooms too," Mog whispered.

32
00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.591
"I think people are stealing them."

33
00:01:54.611 --> 00:01:58.152
"What?" Ben felt his eyes widen.

34
00:01:58.624 --> 00:01:59.605
"Why do you think that?"

35
00:01:59.625 --> 00:02:04.768
"I was sneaking around in People Place the other day," said Mog.

36
00:02:04.788 --> 00:02:08.450
"I saw two brooms on the roof of a house.

37
00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:14.753
I couldn't climb up to get them, but I could clearly see 'MA' on the handles."

38
00:02:17.095 --> 00:02:19.076
Ben peered at Mog in the moonlight.

39
00:02:19.696 --> 00:02:20.917
Was he telling the truth?

40
00:02:22.918 --> 00:02:24.799
"Why would people steal the brooms?"

41
00:02:25.359 --> 00:02:25.980
asked Ben.

42
00:02:27.004 --> 00:02:28.645
"And how could they make them fly?"

43
00:02:28.666 --> 00:02:30.607
"I don't know."

44
00:02:31.087 --> 00:02:31.828
Mog shrugged.

45
00:02:31.848 --> 00:02:34.991
"Maybe it's because the brooms are magic.

46
00:02:35.191 --> 00:02:38.413
The people are probably jealous and want to learn how to fly them.

47
00:02:38.854 --> 00:02:41.376
And that's why the brooms are crashing all over the place.

48
00:02:41.836 --> 00:02:43.377
The people don't know what they're doing."

49
00:02:45.359 --> 00:02:47.040
Ben still didn't trust Mog.

50
00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:52.344
"If people did steal the brooms, why did they put them on a roof?

51
00:02:52.885 --> 00:02:53.986
That doesn't make sense."

52
00:02:55.267 --> 00:02:56.348
Mog shrugged again.

53
00:02:57.068 --> 00:02:59.590
"They probably just thought it was a good hiding spot.

54
00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.751
After all, who would think to look up on a roof?"

55
00:03:05.273 --> 00:03:07.274
"That makes sense," said Ben.

56
00:03:07.294 --> 00:03:09.715
"So did you tell Mr.

57
00:03:09.775 --> 00:03:11.036
Freaky you saw the brooms?"

58
00:03:12.677 --> 00:03:14.178
"No," said Mog.

59
00:03:14.198 --> 00:03:18.260
"I didn't want to get in trouble for sneaking around People Place."

60
00:03:19.441 --> 00:03:21.562
He paused and seemed to think for a moment.

61
00:03:21.582 --> 00:03:24.724
"You're a ghost, though.

62
00:03:25.172 --> 00:03:28.153
You could easily fly into People Place and get the brooms back."

63
00:03:29.133 --> 00:03:31.014
Ben looked suspiciously at Mog.

64
00:03:31.634 --> 00:03:33.415
Could he really trust this monster?

65
00:03:33.435 --> 00:03:36.836
"Listen," said Mog.

66
00:03:36.856 --> 00:03:41.037
"If we get those brooms back, we can put them in the broom closet.

67
00:03:42.117 --> 00:03:44.918
Then, as long as they don't disappear again, Mr.

68
00:03:44.978 --> 00:03:48.219
Freaky will probably change his mind about the Monster Mash dance.

69
00:03:48.839 --> 00:03:50.700
And you know Winnie will be happy."

70
00:03:52.936 --> 00:03:54.037
Ben thought about this.

71
00:03:54.857 --> 00:03:56.398
Mog might be telling the truth.

72
00:03:57.478 --> 00:03:59.959
Then again, Mog was probably lying.

73
00:04:00.679 --> 00:04:02.340
Maybe he wanted to get Ben in trouble.

74
00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:06.302
Mog certainly wouldn't want Winnie to feel grateful to Ben.

75
00:04:07.402 --> 00:04:12.024
Still, it couldn't hurt to fly over People Place just to see the brooms, could it?

76
00:04:13.805 --> 00:04:15.045
Finally Ben nodded.

77
00:04:15.065 --> 00:04:17.026
"Okay, I'll do it.

78
00:04:17.626 --> 00:04:18.306
Where's the house?"

79
00:04:19.447 --> 00:04:21.688
"Awesome," said Mog with a grin.

80
00:04:23.281 --> 00:04:24.902
"It's a big house on Main Street.

81
00:04:25.242 --> 00:04:27.063
It's only a few blocks from the fence.

82
00:04:27.464 --> 00:04:29.485
The house is yellow, and it has a tower.

83
00:04:29.625 --> 00:04:30.766
You can't miss it."

84
00:04:32.267 --> 00:04:33.589
Ben took a deep breath.

85
00:04:33.609 --> 00:04:36.251
"I'll be back soon."

86
00:04:36.271 --> 00:04:42.836
"I'll be waiting right here," whispered Mog as Ben flew off.

87
00:04:43.936 --> 00:04:48.100
Ben couldn't believe he was actually flying over the fence and into People Place.

88
00:04:51.388 --> 00:04:53.309
On the other side, he looked around.

89
00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:59.734
Without any people, the town looked a lot like Monsterville, with schools and stores and parks.

90
00:05:00.995 --> 00:05:04.337
Still, Ben knew he couldn't spend too much time looking around.

91
00:05:05.418 --> 00:05:07.999
If he got caught, he'd be in serious trouble.

92
00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.422
Ben flew a bit farther and found Main Street.

93
00:05:12.102 --> 00:05:15.484
It was lined with houses, and cars were parked along the street.

94
00:05:16.505 --> 00:05:18.787
He quickly spotted the yellow house with the tower.

95
00:05:19.687 --> 00:05:22.893
He flew over it, but he didn't see any brooms on the roof.

96
00:05:22.913 --> 00:05:26.855
"Mog definitely lied to me," thought Ben.

97
00:05:27.375 --> 00:05:29.976
There were no brooms from Monster Academy here.

98
00:05:30.776 --> 00:05:34.778
Ben was hovering outside a window when he noticed a young boy inside.

99
00:05:35.798 --> 00:05:41.101
The boy was fast asleep in bed, hugging a giant stuffed teddy bear almost as big as Ben.

100
00:05:42.221 --> 00:05:45.582
Suddenly there was a loud crashing sound from back by the fence.

101
00:05:46.663 --> 00:05:49.024
A couple of lights in nearby houses blinked on.

102
00:05:50.113 --> 00:05:51.798
The boy sat bolt upright in bed.

103
00:05:52.821 --> 00:05:54.807
He stared directly at Ben and shrieked,
